{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat WORKSPACE.md && cat packages/contracts/package.json && cat packages/contracts/foundry.toml && rg -n 'transfer|destination|immutable|prize|threat|unsafe|self|ticket' DESIGN.md packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol\"","aggregated_output":"# Dependency Workspace\n\nCurrent working directory / primary repository root: /workspace\nWorkspace manifest: WORKSPACE.json\nDependency repositories are checked out as top-level directories inside the same workspace root.\nWhen reporting file_path for dependency code, prefix it with the dependency alias directory.\nPrimary repository: clean-context @ LOCAL_SNAPSHOT\nNo dependency checkouts are listed in WORKSPACE.json.\n\nPath guidance:\n- Reference primary repo files relative to the workspace root.\n- Reference dependency files with their dependency directory prefix, e.g. `agave/...`.\n{\n  \"name\": \"@raffle-fun/contracts\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=22.13 <23\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"hardhat compile && forge build\",\n    \"compile\": \"hardhat compile\",\n    \"test\": \"pnpm test:foundry && pnpm test:hardhat\",\n    \"test:foundry\": \"forge test\",\n    \"test:hardhat\": \"hardhat test nodejs\",\n    \"coverage\": \"forge coverage --report lcov --no-match-coverage '^(script/|src/mocks/|test/)' && node scripts/check-coverage.mjs\",\n    \"gas\": \"forge snapshot --check -j 1 --no-match-test '^(testFuzz|invariant)'\",\n    \"gas:update\": \"forge snapshot -j 1 --no-match-test '^(testFuzz|invariant)'\",\n    \"fmt\": \"forge fmt\",\n    \"fmt:check\": \"forge fmt --check\",\n    \"lint\": \"solhint 'src/**/*.sol' 'test/**/*.sol'\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"slither\": \"slither . --config-file slither.config.json\",\n    \"deploy:sepolia\": \"hardhat ignition deploy ignition/modules/RaffleFun.ts --network sepolia\",\n    \"verify:sepolia\": \"hardhat ignition verify chain-11155111\",\n    \"deployment:write\": \"tsx scripts/write-deployment.ts\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@chainlink/contracts\": \"1.5.0\",\n    \"@openzeppelin/contracts\": \"5.6.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-ignition\": \"3.1.8\",\n    \"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-ignition-viem\": \"3.1.6\",\n    \"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-toolbox-viem\": \"5.0.7\",\n    \"@types/node\": \"26.1.2\",\n    \"dotenv\": \"17.4.2\",\n    \"hardhat\": \"3.11.1\",\n    \"solhint\": \"6.2.3\",\n    \"tsx\": \"4.23.1\",\n    \"typescript\": \"6.0.3\",\n    \"viem\": \"2.55.10\",\n    \"zod\": \"4.4.3\"\n  }\n}\n[profile.default]\nsrc = \"src\"\ntest = \"test/foundry\"\nscript = \"script\"\nout = \"out\"\nlibs = [\"lib\", \"node_modules\"]\nsolc_version = \"0.8.36\"\nevm_version = \"cancun\"\noptimizer = true\noptimizer_runs = 200\nvia_ir = false\nfuzz = { runs = 1_000, seed = \"0x524146464c45\" }\ninvariant = { runs = 256, depth = 64, fail_on_revert = false }\ngas_reports = [\"Raffle\", \"RaffleFactory\"]\n\n[profile.ci]\nfuzz = { runs = 10_000 }\ninvariant = { runs = 1_000, depth = 256, fail_on_revert = false }\n\n[profile.audit]\nfuzz = { runs = 100_000, seed = \"0x41554449545f46555a5a\" }\ninvariant = { runs = 1_000, depth = 256, fail_on_revert = false }\n\n[profile.audit_strict]\nfuzz = { runs = 10_000, seed = \"0x41554449545f535452494354\" }\ninvariant = { runs = 1_000, depth = 256, fail_on_revert = true }\n\n[profile.audit_release]\nfuzz = { runs = 100_000, seed = \"0x52454c454153455f43414d504149474e\" }\ninvariant = { runs = 5_000, depth = 512, fail_on_revert = true, timeout = 3_600 }\n\n[profile.coverage]\nvia_ir = false\noptimizer = false\n\n[profile.comparison]\nvia_ir = true\noptimizer = true\noptimizer_runs = 1_000\n\n[fmt]\nline_length = 120\ntab_width = 4\nbracket_spacing = true\nint_types = \"long\"\nquote_style = \"double\"\nnumber_underscore = \"thousands\"\nsort_imports = true\nDESIGN.md:2:Ethereum NFT raffle; immutable factory, ERC-1167 clones with immutable implementation. One entry costs 1,000,000 units of canonical six-decimal USDC. One purchase mints a transferable ERC721 ticket representing a contiguous inclusive range. Exactly one ERC721 prize is escrowed atomically at creation. Reserve met awards NFT and 95% sponsor / 5% treasury. Reserve missed awards 80% gross to winner, 15% sponsor, 5% treasury. Refund outcome pays 100% per entry and returns prize. Rounding is floor on aggregate protocol fee; remainder must be allocated without loss. No administrator, mutable configuration or upgrade. Request window [sale end, end+2days); callback accepted strictly before request timestamp+2days. Refunds open at deadline. Callback records result only. Settlement is permissionless, storage-only; redemption requires current ticket owner, burns claim atomically, and must revert all effects on delivery failure. Sponsor and treasury can claim independently after settlement. Never move assets between raffle clones. Quote token and Chainlink wrapper are trusted canonical dependencies; arbitrary prize contracts and ticket recipients are untrusted. Frontend discovery is advisory; transaction decisions must reread current chain state.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:10:/// @notice Defines one autonomous NFT raffle using fixed-price USDC entries and one transferable ERC-721 ticket per\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:12:/// @dev Ticket IDs are sequential. Each ticket stores one inclusive uint128 entry range and remains a transferable\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:13:///      bearer claim until its owner atomically burns it for redemption or refund. The immutable quote token is trusted\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:14:///      canonical six-decimal USDC with standard, non-rebasing, fee-free transfers. Supported prizes are honest,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:22:        /// @notice The clone is initialized and waiting for the factory to escrow the configured prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:24:        /// @notice The prize is escrowed and entry sales or post-sale draw initiation are available.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:28:        /// @notice The reserve was met and the winning ticket may redeem the prize NFT.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:30:        /// @notice The reserve was missed and the winning ticket may redeem its cash allocation.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:32:        /// @notice Full ticket refunds are enabled and the sponsor may recover the prize NFT.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:38:    /// @param sponsorRecipient Immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and any returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:40:    /// @param prizeToken Standards-compliant ERC-721 prize contract.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:41:    /// @param prizeTokenId Token ID of the prize escrowed by this raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:49:        address prizeToken;\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:50:        uint256 prizeTokenId;\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:58:    /// @notice Emitted when the factory deposits the configured prize and activates the raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:59:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 contract of the deposited prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:60:    /// @param prizeTokenId Token ID of the deposited prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:61:    /// @param sponsor Address that deposited the prize through the factory.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:62:    event PrizeDeposited(address indexed prizeToken, uint256 indexed prizeTokenId, address indexed sponsor);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:64:    /// @notice Emitted when a buyer pays for entries and one range ticket is minted.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:66:    /// @param recipient Address that received the newly minted ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:67:    /// @param ticketId Sequential ticket ID assigned to the purchase.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:68:    /// @param firstEntry First global raffle entry represented by the ticket, inclusive.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:69:    /// @param lastEntry Last global raffle entry represented by the ticket, inclusive.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:70:    /// @param entryCount Number of entries represented by the ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:75:        uint256 indexed ticketId,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:112:    /// @param remainingRefundLiability Raw six-decimal quote-token units initially available for ticket refunds.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:115:    /// @notice Emitted when the winning ticket is proven and all terminal quote-token liabilities are allocated.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:116:    /// @param ticketId Ticket proven to contain the selected winning entry.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:123:        uint256 indexed ticketId,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:131:    /// @notice Emitted when the winning ticket owner burns the ticket and receives the corresponding prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:132:    /// @param ticketId Burned winning ticket ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:133:    /// @param winner Ticket owner that received the prize at redemption time.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:136:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 prize contract for `NftWon`; the zero address for `CashWon`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:137:    /// @param prizeTokenId ERC-721 prize token ID for `NftWon`; zero for `CashWon`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:139:        uint256 indexed ticketId,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:143:        address prizeToken,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:144:        uint256 prizeTokenId\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:147:    /// @notice Emitted when an owner burns one or more tickets for a full quote-token refund.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:148:    /// @param owner Ticket owner that burned the tickets and received the refund.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:149:    /// @param ticketQuantity Number of tickets burned in this transaction.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:150:    /// @param entryQuantity Aggregate number of entries represented by the burned tickets.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:155:        uint256 ticketQuantity,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:161:    /// @notice Emitted when the complete current sponsor balance is released to its immutable recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:167:    /// @notice Emitted when the complete current protocol-fee balance is released to the immutable treasury.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:173:    /// @notice Emitted when the escrowed prize is returned after a cash result or refund transition.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:175:    /// @param recipient Immutable sponsor recipient that received the prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:176:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 contract of the returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:177:    /// @param prizeTokenId Token ID of the returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:179:        address indexed caller, address indexed recipient, address indexed prizeToken, uint256 prizeTokenId\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:184:    /// @notice Raised when a caller other than the immutable factory attempts clone initialization.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:197:    /// @notice Raised when an ERC-721 receiver callback does not exactly match the configured factory prize deposit.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:201:    /// @param operator Address identified as the transfer operator.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:209:    /// @notice Raised when an entry ticket would be minted to the zero address.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:220:    /// @notice Raised when a refund batch is empty or exceeds the bounded ticket limit.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:221:    /// @param quantity Number of supplied ticket IDs.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:222:    /// @param maximum Maximum ticket IDs accepted per refund transaction.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:225:    /// @notice Raised when a quote-token claim targets a known protocol destination that could strand the claim.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:226:    /// @param destination Rejected payout recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:227:    error InvalidQuoteDestination(address destination);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:266:    /// @notice Raised when initialization or a ticket transfer targets known protocol plumbing.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:267:    /// @param destination Rejected address.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:268:    error UnsafeProtocolDestination(address destination);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:270:    /// @notice Raised when the caller is not the current owner of the supplied ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:271:    /// @param ticketId Ticket whose ownership was checked.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:273:    /// @param owner Current ticket owner.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:274:    error NotTicketOwner(uint256 ticketId, address caller, address owner);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:276:    /// @notice Raised when the supplied ticket range does not contain the selected winning entry.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:277:    /// @param ticketId Supplied ticket ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:279:    error TicketDoesNotContainWinningEntry(uint256 ticketId, uint128 winningEntry);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:284:    /// @notice Raised when redemption supplies a ticket other than the recorded winning ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:286:    /// @param winningTicketId Previously settled winning ticket ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:289:    /// @notice Raised when the winning ticket has already been burned and redeemed.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:292:    /// @notice Raised when the sponsor prize cannot be returned in the current result state.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:296:    /// @notice Raised when the escrowed prize has already been released.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:299:    /// @notice Raised when the prize token does not report the expected owner after transfer.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:300:    /// @param recipient Address that should own the prize after delivery.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:305:    /// @notice Initializes a fresh fixed-target clone with its immutable-per-raffle configuration.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:306:    /// @dev Callable exactly once and only by the immutable canonical factory. Prize escrow activates the raffle later.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:307:    /// @param params Clone-specific sponsor, prize, accounting, identifier, reserve, and timing configuration.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:310:    /// @notice Buys any positive number of entries and mints one sequential ticket containing their inclusive range.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:311:    /// @param recipient Address that receives the newly minted ERC-721 range ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:312:    /// @param entryCount Prospective number of entries to buy for this ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:313:    /// @return ticketId Sequential ID of the newly minted ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:314:    function buyEntries(address recipient, uint128 entryCount) external returns (uint256 ticketId);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:326:    /// @notice Proves which ticket contains the winning entry and allocates winner, sponsor, and protocol liabilities.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:327:    /// @dev Anyone may execute; ownership is not read, the ticket remains transferable, and no external asset transfer\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:329:    /// @param ticketId Ticket whose stored inclusive range must contain `winningEntry`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:331:    function settleWinningTicket(uint256 ticketId) external returns (uint256 cashAmount);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:333:    /// @notice Lets the current winning-ticket owner atomically burn the ticket and receive the NFT or cash prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:334:    /// @dev If necessary, this first settles the supplied winning ticket so the owner can complete both steps in one\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:336:    /// @param ticketId Winning ticket to settle if needed, burn, and redeem.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:338:    function redeemWinningTicket(uint256 ticketId) external returns (uint256 cashAmount);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:340:    /// @notice Burns an owner-selected batch of tickets and returns their full entry purchase value.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:341:    /// @dev Accepts one to 100 tickets. Duplicate, nonexistent, or foreign-owned IDs revert the entire batch.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:342:    /// @param ticketIds Ticket IDs owned by the caller and submitted for refund.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:344:    function refundTickets(uint256[] calldata ticketIds) external returns (uint256 amount);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:346:    /// @notice Releases the complete current sponsor-proceeds balance to the immutable sponsor recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:350:    /// @notice Releases the complete current protocol-fee balance to the immutable treasury.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:354:    /// @notice Returns the escrowed prize to the immutable sponsor recipient after `CashWon` or `Refunding`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:368:    /// @notice Returns the inclusive global entry range represented by a ticket ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:369:    /// @dev Returns zeros for an ID that has never been minted; ranges remain historical after ticket burns.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:370:    /// @param ticketId Sequential ticket ID to inspect.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:373:    function ticketRange(uint256 ticketId) external view returns (uint128 firstEntry, uint128 lastEntry);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:406:    /// @notice Returns the immutable factory authorized to initialize this implementation's clones.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:410:    /// @notice Returns the prize depositor and pre-end empty-raffle refund authority.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:414:    /// @notice Returns the immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and returned prizes.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:418:    /// @notice Returns the immutable recipient of this raffle's protocol fees.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:422:    /// @notice Returns the immutable canonical six-decimal USDC contract.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:426:    /// @notice Returns the immutable Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:430:    /// @notice Returns the configured ERC-721 prize contract.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:432:    function prizeToken() external view returns (IERC721 token);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:434:    /// @notice Returns the configured ERC-721 prize token ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:435:    /// @return tokenId Escrowed prize token ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:436:    function prizeTokenId() external view returns (uint256 tokenId);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:454:    /// @notice Returns the lifetime number of range tickets minted.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:455:    /// @return tickets Ticket count; also the latest assigned ticket ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:456:    function ticketCount() external view returns (uint128 tickets);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:463:    /// @return amount Raw six-decimal quote-token units still claimable by unrefunded tickets.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:466:    /// @notice Returns the address that burned and redeemed the winning ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:471:    /// @return amount Raw six-decimal quote-token units claimable by the winning ticket, or zero otherwise.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:475:    /// @return amount Raw six-decimal quote-token units claimable by the immutable sponsor recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:479:    /// @return amount Raw six-decimal quote-token units claimable by the immutable treasury.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:498:    /// @notice Returns the ticket proven to contain the winning entry.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:499:    /// @return ticketId Sequential ticket ID, or zero before settlement.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:500:    function winningTicketId() external view returns (uint256 ticketId);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:507:    /// @return complete True after winning-ticket settlement.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:510:    /// @notice Returns whether the winning ticket has been burned and its NFT or cash prize delivered.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:514:    /// @notice Returns whether the prize has been delivered to the winner or returned to the sponsor recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:515:    /// @return claimed True after successful prize release.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:516:    function prizeClaimed() external view returns (bool claimed);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:6:/// @notice Defines atomic ERC-1167 raffle creation for one immutable USDC, treasury, and Chainlink configuration.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:8:///      verify that the immutable quote-token address is the target chain's official USDC; onchain construction checks\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:15:    /// @param sponsorRecipient Immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and any returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:16:    /// @param prizeToken Standards-compliant ERC-721 prize contract.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:17:    /// @param prizeTokenId Token ID to escrow atomically during creation.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:22:        address prizeToken;\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:23:        uint256 prizeTokenId;\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:34:    /// @param sponsorRecipient Immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and any returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:35:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 contract of the escrowed prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:36:    /// @param prizeTokenId Token ID of the escrowed prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:46:        address prizeToken,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:47:        uint256 prizeTokenId,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:72:    /// @notice Raised when the prize contract does not report ERC-721 interface support.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:73:    /// @param prizeToken Rejected prize-token contract.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:74:    error UnsupportedPrizeToken(address prizeToken);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:90:    /// @param destination Rejected address.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:91:    error UnsafeProtocolDestination(address destination);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:93:    /// @notice Raised when the exact configured prize is not owned by an active clone after escrow.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:94:    /// @param raffle Newly created clone expected to hold the prize and report `Active`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:95:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 prize contract.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:96:    /// @param prizeTokenId Configured prize token ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:97:    error PrizeEscrowVerificationFailed(address raffle, address prizeToken, uint256 prizeTokenId);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:102:    /// @param params Sponsor-selected recipient, prize, reserve, and timing configuration.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:108:    /// @notice Returns the immutable canonical six-decimal USDC contract used by every raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:112:    /// @notice Returns the immutable Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper used by every raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:116:    /// @notice Returns the immutable recipient of protocol fees from every raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:128:    /// @notice Returns the immutable implementation targeted by every registered ERC-1167 clone.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
